          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "TEXTURE IN\n\nThe Texture In is the node that represents the texture coming from Arena/Avenue.\nIn Wire we use either the Wire Logo or Test Card as dummies.\nThe dummy texture can be selected in the node panel.\n\nThe Texture In node is essential for effects (requires one Texture In node) and mixers (requires two)."
          }
        },
